{
  "id": "runner_05_stealing",
  "side": "Runner",
  "title": "Accessing and stealing",
  "intro": "When you access an agenda you steal it: it goes to your score area and its points count for you. Six points win the starter game. R&D is the Corp's deck, and a run on it accesses the top card — whatever the Corp will draw next.\n\nThis lesson: run R&D and steal what is on top.",
  "outro": "Two points. An agenda is worth the same to whoever scores it, which is why the Corp hides them behind ice and why you run. Next: accessing more than one card at a time.",
